!.......!.......x
x!......!.......x
 x!.....!.......x
  x!....!.......x
   x!...!.......x
    x!..!.......x
     x!.!.......x
      x!!.......x	# tab replaces one char as part of longer run
       x!.......x
!.......x!......x
!....... x!.....x
!.......  x!....x
!.......   x!...x
!.......    x!..x
!.......     x!.x
!.......      x x	# tab does not replace one-char run
!.......       xx
!.......!.......x
abcde!..x
abcdef!.x
abcdefg x
abcdefg  x
abcdefg   x
abcdefg    x
abcdefg     x
abcdefg      x
abcdefg       x
